\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems, record 1449 (ALG-004). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
\item[S2] Emiel Lorist and Felix L. Schwenninger, A Solution to Crouzeix’s Conjecture, arXiv:2608.03841v2 (2026), Section 1, equation (1), and Theorem 3 with its holomorphic functional-calculus formulation. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.03841v2}.
\end{description}
